experimental_conditions:
1) Scene camera only: helper could view the output of the IP camera focused on the workers task environment, but could not manipulate the video feed; 
2) DOVE + manual erasure of gestures: helper could draw on the video feed but had to manually erase their gestures; and 
3) DOVE + automatic erasure of gestures: helpers could draw on the video feed and the gestures faded out after 3 seconds.
